==About==
<section begin="Intro"/>'''[[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2026|RLCS 2026]]''' is the fifteenth season of the [[Rocket League Championship Series]], starting in late 2025. This season introduces new features including the inaugural [[Rocket League Championship Series/2026/Kick-Off Weekend|Kick-Off Weekend]] and the integration of [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2026/2v2|2v2]], extending the league to three competitive game modes.  Like in 2024 and 2025, 2 splits each have 3 regional opens leading into an international major. The season concludes with the World Championship, that welcomes the best-performing teams in these events and the winners of the Last Chance Qualifiers.<section end="Intro"/>

The '''RLCS 2026 World Championship''' {{IsTournamentFinished|took|will take|is taking}} place in Fort Worth, United States at the [https://dickiesarena.com/ Dickies Arena].

===Format===
*'''Play-In''' - ''September 15th''
** 8-Team GSL Play-In.
*** All matches are {{Bo|5}}.
**Top 4 Teams advance to the [[#Group Stage|Group Stage]].
<br>
*'''Group Stage''' - ''September 16th-17th''
**16 teams including the 4 from the [[#Play-In|Play-In]] - split into 4 groups of 4.
**Single Round Robin.
***All matches are {{Bo|5}}.
****<span class="bg-up">Winner</span> of each group qualifies to the Upper Bracket of the [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
****<span class="bg-stay">Place 2 and 3</span> of each group qualify to the Lower Bracket of the [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
****<span class="bg-down">4th</span> of each group are eliminated.
*** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Side-Selection" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''See the group stage tiebreakers:''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Side-Selection" style="margin-top:10px;">
*Match Record against tied Teams
*Game Differential against tied Teams
*Overall Game Differential
*Goal Differential against tied Teams
*Overall Goal Differential
*Initial Seed
</div>
<br>
*'''Playoffs''' - ''September 18th-20th''
**12-Teams Hybrid Elimination Bracket.
**Top 4 of the [[#Group Stage|Group Stage]] start with two chances before the Final Four, whereas teams ranked 5th-12th start with one chance.
***All matches are {{Bo|7}}.
<br>
''Crowd Days: September 18th-20th''

